     "body": "<p>Implementation:</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>new system property in POM - fedora.authorize.access</li>\n\t<li>set to true for ConfigB, set to false for other configs</li>\n\t<li>new method in TestRESTAPI - getAuthAccess() reads this property</li>\n\t<li>all \"access\" API calls expecting success use getAuthAccess() instead of true for authorization parameter</li>\n\t<li>all \"access\" API calls testing for unauthorized wrapped in If (getAuthAccess()) to only execute test under ConfigB</li>\n\t<li>all \"management\" calls as before (auth required for A and B)</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>Add TestRESTAPI to ConfigA test suite</li>\n\t<li>ConfigA now fails on four tests due to \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-703\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-703\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"REST API calls to getDatastreamDissemination fails when XACML enabled, API-A auth disabled\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-703\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n (as expected)</li>\n\t<li>ConfigB passes all tests</li>\n</ul>\n\n",
     "created": "15/Jun/10 11:52 AM",
